<title>QATAR: SQUASH-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the first round of the</p>
<p>$65,000 Qatar International Squash Tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Mark Chaloner (England) beat David Evans (Wales) 13-15 15-6</p>
<p>15-9 15-10</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Mark Cairns (England) 15-9 17-14</p>
<p>15-7</p>
<p>Mir Zaman Gul (Pakistan) beat Saud Al Sulaiti (Qatar) 15-10</p>
<p>15-1 15-11</p>
<p>4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Craig Wapnick (South Africa) 16-17 15-17 15-9 15-5 15-12 Dan Jenson (Australia) beat Derek Ryan (Ireland) 15-8 17-16 15-9 Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Abdul Faheem Khan (Hong Kong) 15-10 10-15 15-5 15-13</p>
</text>
